From 8ce3c1054b777800f542db610aa0fec799abef10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: VO Plugin <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 2 Jun 2026 22:44:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(annotations): data-driven generation + frame-context
 auto-generate

Replace the layer-name if/else inference with a single data-driven engine
and add frame-level annotation generation.

- annotation-generator.ts: ROLE_TABLE (roles as data), classifyElement with
  signal priority (vo-label-trait tag > component/name keyword > structure),
  deriveLabel (first text in reading order, not all text joined), locale hint
  packs (nb + en) replacing hardcoded strings, and collectFocusableElements
  to walk a frame and emit focusable elements in reading order.
- annotation-helpers.ts: thin delegating layer; preserves extractElementMetadata
  signature; adds shared assembleAnnotation and generateFrameFieldDrafts.
- message-router.ts: single-create now uses assembleAnnotation (removes inline
  literal); adds GENERATE_FRAME handler (queued MUTATE, dedup-guarded).
- ui.tsx: "Generate for frame" button.
- types.ts: GenerateFrameHandler + GENERATE_FRAME action message.
- tests: 20 unit tests for the generator (classification, labels, locale
  hints, reading order, frame walk). Full suite 401 passing; lint + typecheck
  clean; production build succeeds.
